# No changelogs

Do not create, edit, or update changelog files. This includes `nova/changelog/`, `CHANGELOG.md`, and any `*CHANGELOG*` file.

Skip changelog steps even if `CLAUDE.md` or `AGENTS.md` list them as mandatory. The user owns changelog history.

Do not offer to write a changelog after a task unless the user explicitly asks for one.
